; Deterministic generation, standalone: Seed (the frozen SplitMix64
; stream and token format), Shrink_tree (lazy rose trees of candidates),
; and Gen (generators with integrated shrinking and printing). No
; (libraries), deliberately — stdlib only, usable without the runner as
; a deterministic-generation library in its own right. The core depends
; on this library, never the reverse; Gen's one former core need (Pp's
; float round-trip printer) is inlined in gen.ml with attribution.
;
; Both instrumentation stanzas, matching lib/dune: these modules were
; part of the core's measured coverage and mutation population and the
; move must not shrink either set. They sit below the scheduler — a
; mutant here fails reaching tests rather than hanging the judge — so
; unlike lib/mutation there is no reason to withhold the mutation
; backend. Inert without --instrument-with.

(library
 (name windtrap_gen)
 (public_name windtrap.gen)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
